     se:statement "The CS2023 curriculum teaches requirements elicitation through multiple source groups (users, administrators and support personnel as examples) and multiple gathering methods (surveys, interviews and behavioral analysis as examples)." .

se:CLM-REQ-FUNCTIONAL-DOC-METHODS a se:KnowledgeClaim ;
