     se:statement "In the CS2023 curriculum, functional requirements are to be described using at least one documentation and structuring method (use cases and user stories are the named examples), with explicit attention to how the method supports design and implementation and to the strengths and weaknesses of the specific approach." .

se:CLM-REQ-PROTOTYPE-DUAL-ROLE a se:KnowledgeClaim ;
