     se:record_version "0.1.0" ;
     se:result "Provides the inference trail motivating the se:ANT-07D-HOPE-BASED-OPERATIONS record." ;
     se:source_locator_ref se:LOC-07D-SWEBOK-KA6-MONITOR ;
     se:statement "Lane synthesis (SEK-07D): SWEBOK KA6 section 4.3 explicitly rejects operating on hope (\"hope should not be a strategy\") and demands real-time evidence about quality and operational health, while CS2023's SE-Reliability unit lists measurement-based analysis (telemetry, monitoring and alerting, dashboards, release qualification metrics) as its reliability-analysis topic. On that combined reading, running an operated software service without a measurement/telemetry feedback loop leaves its reliability, capacity and availability unobserved, so deviations are discovered by stakeholders rather than by evidence." ;
     se:synthetic "false"^^xsd:boolean ;
     se:uncertainty "Whether real teams operating without telemetry always incur the listed consequences is untested in this lane." .

