     se:record_version "0.1.0" ;
     se:result "Provides the inference trail motivating the se:ANT-REQ-IMPLICIT-QUALITY-ATTRIBUTES record." ;
     se:source_locator_ref se:LOC-CS2023-SE-REQ-KU ;
     se:statement "Lane synthesis (SEK-06A): within the CS2023 SE-Requirements unit, quality attributes (non-functional requirements) form a named KA Core topic (topic 4) alongside the requirement that functional-requirement documentation methods demonstrably support design and implementation (topic 1); on that combined reading, leaving quality attributes implicit or deferring their specification discards information the curriculum itself treats as core requirements knowledge." ;
     se:synthetic "false"^^xsd:boolean ;
     se:uncertainty "Whether real teams that defer quality attributes always incur the listed consequences is untested in this lane." .

