     se:verification_state "LOCATOR_VERIFIED" ;
     se:verified_content_summary "Risk vs. uncertainty distinction; identify/analyze/prioritize/mitigate cycle with risk register and periodic revisits; quality requirements identified quantitatively and qualitatively with per-requirement acceptance thresholds and planned SQA/V&V/review/audit procedures; planning magnitude driven partly by the risk of not planning." .

