     se:created_on "2026-11-07" ;
     se:definition "The SWEBOK Guide v4.0a Software Engineering Operations knowledge area as represented by the sections this lane directly inspected: operations planning release/version tasks (2.1.1), development and operational environments (2.2), deployment/release engineering (3.2) and rollback with data migration (3.3). The KA's remaining sections are outside this node's evidenced scope." ;
     se:evidence_refs se:EVD-07E-SWEBOK-KA6-DEPLOY-RELEASE ;
