     se:created_on "2026-11-07" ;
     se:definition "The SWEBOK Guide v4.0a Software Configuration Management knowledge area as represented by the sections this lane directly inspected: SCM planning including the continuous-integration characterization (1.3-1.4), CI/baseline relationships with the SBOM and software libraries (2.5-2.6), and software release management and delivery with software building (6, 6.1, 6.2). The KA's remaining sections are outside this node's evidenced scope." ;
     se:evidence_refs se:EVD-07E-SWEBOK-KA8-BUILDING ;
