se:NODE-07G-SEM-PROJECT-PLANNING a se:TaxonomyNode ;
     se:created_on "2026-11-07" ;
     se:definition "The Software Project Planning topic of SWEBOK Guide v4.0a KA9: the activities undertaken to prepare for a successful software engineering project from the management perspective, listed in the chapter's activity-based breakdown alongside process planning, determine deliverables, effort/schedule and cost estimation, resource allocation, risk management, quality management and plan management." ;
     se:evidence_refs se:EVD-07G-SWEBOK-SEM-INTRO ;
