     se:predicate "RELATED_TO" ;
     se:qualifiers "A specification built with this pattern must still capture quality attributes explicitly; the pattern does not subsume them.", "Relation is boundary-keeping: the pattern structures functional requirements only, while quality attributes are a separate requirement category in the same curriculum unit." ;
     se:rationale "CS2023 lists functional-requirement documentation methods (topic 1) and quality attributes (topic 4) as distinct core topics; linking the pattern to the concept records that boundary." ;
