se:SUB-07B-SOFTWARE-CONSTRUCTION a se:Subdomain ;
     se:BOUNDED_BY se:EVD-07B-SWEBOK-CONSTRUCTION-DEFINITION ;
     se:boundary_notes "Boundary against design and testing is life-cycle dependent per SWEBOK KA4; this subdomain node is an anchor for professional-BOK-scoped applicability, not a claim of universal process decomposition.", "Secure-coding content detail (SWEBOK KA13 / SEC-Coding) belongs to lane SEK-07C; this lane records only construction-side placements of defensive/secure coding topics." ;
     se:created_on "2026-11-07" ;
     se:definition "The software engineering subdomain concerned with the detailed creation and maintenance of software through coding and closely associated verification activities (unit testing, integration testing, debugging), as characterized by SWEBOK Guide v4.0a KA4, whose boundaries with design and testing vary with the life cycle processes used." ;
     se:domain_ref se:DOMAIN-SOFTWARE-ENGINEERING ;
     se:evidence_refs se:EVD-07B-SWEBOK-CONSTRUCTION-DEFINITION ;
     se:label "Software Construction (implementation and code engineering)" ;
     se:lifecycle_status "PROPOSED" ;
     se:record_version "0.1.0" .

se:VIEW-07A-SWEBOK-ENGINEERING-FOUNDATIONS a se:TaxonomyView ;
     se:coverage_state "PARTIAL" ;
     se:created_on "2026-11-07" ;
     se:evidence_refs se:EVD-07A-KA18-ENG-PROCESS ;
     se:label "SWEBOK KA18 engineering-foundations lens" ;
     se:lifecycle_status "PROPOSED" ;
     se:limitations "Covers only the inspected KA18 sections 1-3; KA16 Computing Foundations and KA17 Mathematical Foundations are not covered (see se:GAP-07A-FOUNDATIONS-BREADTH).", "Foundations content is admitted only where it directly supports this lane's process/lifecycle/quality-model scope." ;
     se:purpose "Represent the engineering-foundations content of SWEBOK Guide v4.0a KA18 that grounds software engineering's process and modeling thinking — the iterative engineering process, design as a wicked problem, and abstraction levels with alternate abstractions — as a foundations lens for this lane, separate from the process and quality lenses." ;
     se:record_version "0.1.0" ;
     se:view_kind "DISCIPLINE" .

