     se:purpose "Represent the process and life cycle content of SWEBOK Guide v4.0a KA10 Software Engineering Process — process fundamentals, life cycle definitions and process categories, life cycle models and paradigms, life cycle adaptation, and process assessment — as one classification lens, separate from the quality lens and the engineering-foundations lens." ;
