     se:limitations "Covers only the inspected KA12 introduction and sections 1.1-1.4 at their verified locators; quality assurance and V&V process detail belongs to other coverage.", "ISO/IEC 25010 normative quality-model characteristics are not admitted (ACCESS_RESTRICTED registry source).", "Reliability and performance engineering detail is deliberately excluded (SEK-07 lane 07D); only model-level quality compositions are claimed." ;
